1
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:24,360
Do you still want to bet, Your Highness?

2
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:28,560
No.

3
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,460
I want to return to Rouran.

4
00:01:58,600 --> 00:01:59,530
What did you say?

5
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:03,500
The feud between you two brothers has nothing to do with me.

6
00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:06,120
I am now Princess Yu in name.

7
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:08,320
What does it matter where I am?

8
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,919
Besides, Your Highness has already gotten

9
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:11,360
what you wanted,

10
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:13,760
the leverage to fight for the throne.

11
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,640
As for the rest,

12
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,400
I really don't want to be involved anymore.

13
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,200
So, Your Highness,

14
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,860
please send me back to Rouran.

15
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,320
What if I refuse?

16
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,120
People have legs.

17
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:24,120
I can always walk my own path.

18
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:30,680
Xiyao.

19
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,890
Don't blame me for being ruthless.

20
00:02:34,760 --> 00:02:36,490
Since you are already my woman,

21
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:40,780
you can only stay in my Prince Yu's Manor.

22
00:02:54,079 --> 00:02:55,160
Does it hurt?

23
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:06,440
You can tell me now, right?

24
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,200
What?

25
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:12,400
What riddle were you and Yuwen Jia playing?

26
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,400
No.

27
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:17,160
I can't tell Jingxuan the whole truth yet.

28
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:19,280
I bluffed him.

29
00:03:21,520 --> 00:03:22,380
Think about it.

30
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:25,680
Yuwen Jia clearly had the chance to strike before,

31
00:03:26,079 --> 00:03:27,520
but he didn't kill me.

32
00:03:28,079 --> 00:03:30,240
There must be a reason why he couldn't.

33
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:35,040
Oh.

34
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,340
Where is Mr. Su?

35
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:40,050
Probably went to find Princess Xiyao.

36
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,010
Does it hurt?

37
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:54,840
No.

38
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:10,970
What did you say?

39
00:04:11,800 --> 00:04:13,360
You want to return to Prince Yu's Mansion?

40
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:15,080
I am Princess Yu,

41
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:17,120
and a princess of Rouran.

42
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:19,560
I belong in Prince Yu's Mansion.

43
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:21,839
Xiyao.

44
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,520
I was wrong.

45
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:26,970
Young Master Su, please behave yourself.

46
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,159
No.

47
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,720
Jingxuan.

48
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:12,280
Xiyao seems to have been hit by Yuwen Jia's Soul-Destroying Nail.

49
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,600
How dare he!

50
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:17,240
I didn't expect Prince Yu to be so reckless all of a sudden.

51
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:19,000
Is there something we don't know?

52
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:21,530
Our top priority is to rescue Princess Xiyao.

53
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:25,640
He should be dining at the Empress's palace tonight.

54
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:27,560
He will return to his mansion around the hour of Xu.

55
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:29,000
As long as we plan properly,

56
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,730
we can definitely get her back.

57
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,120
There are no buts.

58
00:05:32,400 --> 00:05:33,530
Go prepare quickly.

59
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:45,020
Yuwen Jia is acting so strangely.

60
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:48,040
You probably know the inside story, don't you?

61
00:05:48,880 --> 00:05:49,800
Be careful.

62
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:55,940
Then we'll talk when you get back.

63
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,640
How is it? Are you hurt anywhere?

64
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,120
Oh, I got hit.

65
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:44,409
Strange, there are no internal injuries.

66
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,320
Hey, I didn't lie to you.

67
00:06:48,159 --> 00:06:50,290
When I came out of Prince Yu's Mansion,

68
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:51,930
I was hit by Princess Xiyao.

69
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:58,840
Right, what about the Soul-Destroying Nail in Princess Xiyao's body?

70
00:06:58,840 --> 00:06:59,640
Don't worry.

71
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:02,720
There's still some antidote left from last time.

72
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,840
I gave it to Aye.

73
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,120
I kept forgetting to ask you before.

74
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,520
How did you

75
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,800
get the antidote from Yuwen Jia?

76
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,280
What?

77
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,770
You don't believe I can beat Yuwen Jia?

78
00:07:21,200 --> 00:07:22,000
Oh, right.

79
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,760
I'll go check on

80
00:07:23,760 --> 00:07:24,690
Princess Xiyao.

81
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,120
Princess Xiyao is fine.

82
00:07:35,560 --> 00:07:37,690
Young Master Su, you can rest assured.

83
00:07:37,760 --> 00:07:39,600
Miss Tang, you are a skilled and kind doctor.

84
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,480
I...

85
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:43,680
Young Master Su, you don't need to be so polite.

86
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:46,960
Miss Tang, you came here alone.

87
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,890
Is there something you want to ask?

88
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:53,040
I was hit by the Soul-Destroying Nail before.

89
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:55,400
Jingxuan went to Yuwen Jia alone for the antidote.

90
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,320
Did you know about this, Young Master Su?

91
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:58,850
Don't you already have the answer, Miss Tang?

92
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:01,760
Yes, it's the Soul Jade.

93
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:04,520
The Soul Jade recognizes its master.

94
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:06,680
Normally, it would return on its own within a few days.

95
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,800
But this time...

96
00:08:09,520 --> 00:08:10,800
Rest assured, Miss Tang.

97
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,640
Jingxuan said

98
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:14,760
the Soul Jade cannot be destroyed by force.

99
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:17,160
Perhaps he used other means to trap it.

100
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,440
That's right.

101
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:22,320
Our Rouran tribe

102
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:24,760
has a family heirloom.

103
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:28,340
It looks like an ordinary wooden box on the outside,

104
00:08:28,440 --> 00:08:31,040
but it can actually trap anything in the world.

105
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:35,480
But it's no longer here.

106
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:39,400
Because Yuwen Jia insisted on having it

107
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:41,000
as her dowry.

108
00:08:48,760 --> 00:08:49,560
Jingxuan.

109
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,600
Jingxuan.

110
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,080
Jingxuan.

111
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:04,890
Let's go.

112
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,480
Get out.
